From: rogerbacardit <rogerbacardit@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:26:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] v0.37.0 device build: track MIDI IN (channel per track)

Backport of 06e2d6b3. v0.37.0 has no track menu yet (it came with Freeze),
so Shift + track opens a one-row menu: MIDI IN, turned by knob 1 or the jog.
Engine ext_route.rs and the UI route/recording/persistence are main's,
unchanged. Gate: local suites + cargo test on this branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
